    "The belt did not stop. Stop it now at the console.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The belt did not stop. Stop it now at the console."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A szalag nem állt meg. Állítsd meg most a konzolon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With heart-rate control on, the app changes the belt's speed or incline by itself to hold your target zone — without you touching anything. Changing speed or incline at the console always takes control back for the rest of that segment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With heart-rate control on, the app changes the belt's speed or incline by itself to hold your target zone — without you touching anything. Changing speed or incline at the console always takes control back for the rest of that segment."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ha a pulzusvezérlés be van kapcsolva, az app önállóan módosítja a szalag sebességét vagy dőlését, hogy megtartsa a célzónádat — anélkül, hogy hozzányúlnál bármihez. A sebesség vagy a dőlés módosítása a konzolon mindig visszaveszi az irányítást a szegmens hátralévő részében."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The belt was stopped because your heart rate reached its limit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The belt was stopped because your heart rate reached its limit."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A szalag leállt, mert a pulzusod elérte a határértékét."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a fitness feature, not a medical device: heart-rate control estimates a target zone and steers toward it, it does not diagnose, monitor or treat any condition.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a fitness feature, not a medical device: heart-rate control estimates a target zone and steers toward it, it does not diagnose, monitor or treat any condition."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ez egy fitneszfunkció, nem orvostechnikai eszköz: a pulzusvezérlés egy célzónát becsül és afelé vezérel, nem diagnosztizál, nem monitoroz és nem kezel semmilyen állapotot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart-rate control changes belt speed by itself": {
