    "On a heart-rate driven segment, the app changes the belt's speed or incline by itself to hold your target zone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On a heart-rate driven segment, the app changes the belt's speed or incline by itself to hold your target zone."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Egy pulzusvezérelt szegmensben az app önállóan módosítja a szalag sebességét vagy dőlését, hogy megtartsa a célzónádat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. You can always take over by changing speed or incline at the console — control then stays yours for the rest of the segment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
