    "The app holds the band by moving speed inside this corridor. If the heart-rate feed is lost for too long, it drops to the fallback speed and holds it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app holds the band by moving speed inside this corridor. If the heart-rate feed is lost for too long, it drops to the fallback speed and holds it."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Az app a sebesség ezen a tartományon belüli mozgatásával tartja a sávot. Ha a pulzusjel túl sokáig megszakad, az app leesik a biztonsági sebességre, és tartja azt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app holds the band by moving incline inside this corridor. If the heart-rate feed is lost for too long, incline drops to the treadmill's own minimum.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app holds the band by moving incline inside this corridor. If the heart-rate feed is lost for too long, incline drops to the treadmill's own minimum."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Az app a dőlés ezen a tartományon belüli mozgatásával tartja a sávot. Ha a pulzusjel túl sokáig megszakad, a dőlés lecsökken a futópad saját minimumára."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The belt starts on its own after a %lld-second countdown. First segment: %@. %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The belt starts on its own after a %lld-second countdown. First segment: %@. %@"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A szalag %lld másodperces visszaszámlálás után magától elindul. Első szegmens: %@. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This band is above what your current heart-rate basis can hold, so the app will not steer it — the segment would run fixed at its start command. Nothing has been changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This band is above what your current heart-rate basis can hold, so the app will not steer it — the segment would run fixed at its start command. Nothing has been changed."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ez a sáv magasabb annál, amit a jelenlegi pulzusalap tartani tud, ezért az app nem vezérel rá — a szegmens rögzített módban, a kezdő értékein futna. Semmi nem változott."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust the band to %lld–%lld bpm": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adjust the band to %lld–%lld bpm"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sáv igazítása %lld–%lld bpm-re"
          }
        }
      }
    },
