            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnosztikai napló"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records the heart-rate loop's own decisions, every belt command and every stop of a program workout into a file on this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records the heart-rate loop's own decisions, every belt command and every stop of a program workout into a file on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pulzusszabályzó saját döntéseit, minden szalagparancsot és minden leállítást fájlba írja ezen az iPhone-on, programedzés közben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No log yet. Switch this on, then start a program workout.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No log yet. Switch this on, then start a program workout."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Még nincs napló. Kapcsold be, majd indíts egy programedzést."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. Nothing leaves this iPhone: the app writes one JSON line per event — governor decisions with their inputs, belt commands, stops, feed gaps — and a file only goes anywhere if you share it. The ten most recent workouts are kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. Nothing leaves this iPhone: the app writes one JSON line per event — governor decisions with their inputs, belt commands, stops, feed gaps — and a file only goes anywhere if you share it. The ten most recent workouts are kept."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alapértelmezetten ki van kapcsolva. Semmi nem hagyja el ezt az iPhone-t: az app eseményenként egy JSON-sort ír — a szabályzó döntéseit a bemeneteikkel, a szalagparancsokat, a leállításokat, a pulzusjel kimaradásait —, és a fájl csak akkor kerül bárhová, ha megosztod. A tíz legutóbbi edzés naplója marad meg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WATCH SIGNAL LOST": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WATCH SIGNAL LOST"
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MEGSZAKADT A JEL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heart-rate control is off in the profile, so this program's heart-rate segments will run fixed, at their start speeds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heart-rate control is off in the profile, so this program's heart-rate segments will run fixed, at their start speeds."
          }
        },
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pulzusvezérlés ki van kapcsolva a profilban, ezért a program pulzusvezérelt szegmensei rögzített módban, a kezdő sebességükön futnak."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
